{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30280","headline":"李先辈擢第东归有赠送 · 薛逢","name":"李先辈擢第东归有赠送","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金榜前头无是非，平人分得一枝归。\n正怜日暖云飘路，何处宴回风满衣？\n门掩长淮心更远，渡连芳草马如飞。\n茂陵自笑犹多病，空有书斋在翠微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30280.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30280","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}